.policy "ruff-pt020-pytest-deprecated-yield-fixture" revision 2
.description "Use the pytest fixture decorator instead of the deprecated yield_fixture alias; fixtures can already yield, so the rename changes nothing else."
.language python
.mode steer
.scope include "**/*"

// Ruff PT020 (flake8-pytest-style): `@pytest.yield_fixture`, deprecated since pytest 6.2; `@pytest.fixture` can
// yield. Reported when it is a function's first fixture decorator.
//   @pytest.yield_fixture()      ← PT020
//   @pytest.fixture              not reported
#include "python/pytest.rr"
//   pytest_fixture(f, d, e), pytest_deco(o, d, e, q)

.violation PT020(at: node) code "PT020"
    "Replace `yield_fixture` with `fixture` (`pytest.fixture`, or `fixture` imported from pytest); it is a deprecated alias of the same function, so nothing else changes."
    suppress ruff "PT020"
PT020(d) :- pytest_fixture(f, d, e), pytest_deco(f, d, e, "pytest.yield_fixture").
